    {
      "id": "league.udyr_stances",
      "label": "Udyr stances and chat guard",
      "topic": "Gameplay HUD",
      "trigger": {
        "label": "Q / W / E / R with Enter guard",
        "event": "keyboard.press",
        "kind": "event"
      },
      "detail": "The existing shared keyboard subscription accepts Q/W/E/R only during known alive gameplay. Keys switch immediately even without clear mana evidence, except during the five seconds after each Enter press. Enter clears previous candidates and extends the guard; it does not toggle chat state. During that guard, a fresh MANA sample showing at least one mana spent within 0.8 seconds accepts the latest candidate key. Ignored chat presses never replay when the guard expires. Three stable observed regeneration intervals allow conservative correction when regeneration masks spending; changed regeneration, mana cap, resource maximum changes, stale or invalid snapshots disable correction. This is mana evidence, not an authoritative ability-cast feed. The existing watcher observes every 250 ms during gameplay through the shared four-per-second HTTP cache, without per-key requests. Q=blue bear, W=green turtle, E=gold ram and R=red phoenix; the current stance never restarts. One PlaybackWorker owns source replacement through cleanup, follows the League permission gate, and releases on death/end/shutdown. Respawn retains the stance; a new game starts blue. Personal filters, transforms, audio controls and other Udyr/lobby sources remain unchanged.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "0",
          "label": "Apply Enter guard and mana evidence",
          "owner": "league",
          "kind": "gate",
          "detail": "Bounded rolling history and expiring candidates"
        },
        {
          "id": "1",
          "label": "Replace accepted stance",
          "owner": "league",
          "kind": "action",
          "detail": "Serialized playback and League permission gate"
        },
        {
          "id": "2",
          "label": "Loop original animation segment",
          "owner": "obs",
          "kind": "output",
          "detail": "Existing masked gameplay media input"
        }
      ],
